<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb gasoline output down 5.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb gasoline output down 5.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 5.3024 million tonnes of gasoline in the first two months of 1997, down 5.5 percent from the year-ago period, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 2.5023 million tonnes of gasoline in February alone, the bureau said without giving comparative data.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
